{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791732420, "covers_from": "2026-10-11T15:27:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-11T15:28:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791732480, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-11T15:27:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 61610, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "松江南京先前遛狗有路邊垃圾桶可丟狗便，但突然消失了，雖然街友減少、夜晚不會有堆積成山的垃圾，但很不便", "display_name": "中山代表 No.61,610", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T15:27:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "queue_number": 61611, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我希望恢復垃圾桶的能見度，讓垃圾可以隨時有丟棄的地方", "display_name": "大安代表 No.61,611", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T15:27:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2977, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望街道上或公車專用候車亭的垃圾桶可以裝回去，加強市民垃圾分類的常識。", "display_name": "中山代表 yl", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T15:27:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5330, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "其他", "content": "社會需要重視心理健康、網路安全、媒體釋讀等可以加入健康教育\n也請推廣補助心理諮商資源及毒品危害防治", "display_name": "信義代表 No.5,330", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T15:27:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 45341, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "其他", "content": "所以他ㄇ的有沒有要聽我講的話，當空氣是不是，管管網軍很難嗎", "display_name": "北投代表 No.45,341", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 61611, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.61,611", "district": "daan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 2977, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 yl", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true},